{#- the lme-genesis-step/3 record of ONE launch (genesis.launch.step_record field names; the flow word, stage, the
    inventory kind and its ordered admitted files, the builder binding, timestamps, the declared capture reference and
    the ACTUAL exit status, then the stage output). Every record key word is emit['keys'], every fixed value
    word is emit['values'] (K3), passed as printf ARGUMENTS; binding_receipt and extra_vars are the ACTUAL values of this
    occurrence (records-c1-framework-27 RH-27-03): binding_receipt_none only for an inventory kind that declares no
    receipt, extra_vars_empty only for an empty xv; the capture reference is the ABSOLUTE runtime path "$_ce" of
    this act's capture evidence file (capture_evidence) and the fidelity is the caller's ACTUAL cfi (one
    retained-evidence contract, codex-tick190 :31-35). The prelaunch context is cold_context's file, never
    this record. s06 K16: every format is COMPOSED from
    emit.formats (no format literal); K17: the emitted word set is checked against fields at render time; K18: the
    written bytes are read back and their top-level shape checked before success. records-b-ggen-cold-launch-08
    (codex-tick827 COLD-RECORD-PREMATURE-SUCCESS): the record is written EXCLUSIVELY into the staging name
    files.record_staging of _ev with the declared step_record.mode and owner, read back (K18) and digested there,
    and only then published by ONE rename (custody tool_argv.rename) onto the absent files.record, then read
    back at its published name (owner, mode, digest equal to the staged digest). An interrupted write or
    publication leaves no files.record; the staging name is never read as a record.
    Requires "$@" = the exec vector, _sr _ev _t0 _t1 _rc _ce, CO ED DS _tr, _dg_<role>, RCP and
    _dg_<kind receipt> when the kind declares a receipt, GEN_ID BX BP _bxd _tmd, _S _N (path law), _uid, and _rf /
    _od / _adm: the stage output path, its sha256, and _adm non-empty ONLY when the occurrence is complete and its
    output admissible (cold_occurrence); outputs carries {path, sha256} only then, else output_none (K5). -#}
{%- macro step_record(bs, c, t, cfi, flow, stage, kind, roles, xv, lv) -%}
{% set l = bs.genesis.launch %}
{% set f = l.step_record.fields %}
{% set k = l.step_record.emit['keys'] %}
{% set v = l.step_record.emit['values'] %}
{% set cf = l.step_record.emit.capture_fidelity %}
{% set fm = l.step_record.emit.formats %}
{% set kd = l.inventory_kinds[kind] %}
{% set eo = bs.genesis.initializer.custody.end_of_options %}
{% set gr = bs.source_admission.rel_path_grammar %}
{#- K16: the line formats, each composed from emit.formats -#}
{% set kv = fm.placeholder ~ fm.key_indicator ~ fm.value_space ~ fm.placeholder %}
{% set hd = fm.placeholder ~ fm.key_indicator %}
{% set hv = hd ~ fm.value_space %}
